# Project-local runtime and integration compatibility manifest.
# setup-local.sh and toolchain/platform.sh are the consumers; keep values
# shell-safe and unquoted.
#
# Checksums are per platform. Adding a platform means adding both checksums
# here and a branch in toolchain/platform.sh — a branch without checksums
# would compare downloads against an empty string.
